cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use healthdata in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "healthdata: Download and read NHANES health survey data in Python"
abstract: >-
  healthdata is a Python package that finds, downloads and reads
  NHANES (National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey) data files
  from the CDC. It saves each file's codebook alongside the data,
  renames cryptic variable codes to readable column names, and attaches
  the documentation for every variable to the resulting pandas DataFrame.
authors:
